   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Forestry SWAp</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let &#xe4;r b&#xe4;ttre applicering av the Aid Effectiveness vid st&#xf6;d till implementeringen av the Policy and Strategy on Forest Sector Development i Kosovo. Huvudsakliga aktiviteterna kommer att vara serminarier, m&#xf6;ten, assistans vid utformandet av viktiga dokument och generell kompetens utveckling.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is a better application of the Aid  Effectiveness in suppot of the imlementation of the Policy and Strategy on Forest Sector Development in Kosovo. Main activities will be seminars, meetings, assistance in drafting key documents and general competence development.</narrative>
  </description>
